---
description: Resolve the actual board-migration goal through semantic composition and exact native authorities.
args:
  goal: string
returns: BoardMigrationOutcome
---
Resolve the requested legacy-board audit or migration from the actual source edition, current target and explicit approval. Choose which source cards and details matter to the goal; archived cards, attachments and checklist entries are not interchangeable with current visible cards. Use exact native source revision and target authority for any retention.

An existing target may already contain the requested material; do not overwrite or duplicate it. A missing or stale approval remains a reason to hold. Compose inquiry and the admitted decision/effect helper from actual feedback, preserving source identity and protected target state. Return the actual requested finding and authentic migration receipt when one exists, without inventing cards, revisions or success.
